  "query": "What is the best routine for dark spots and hyperpigmentation?",
  "full_text": "For dark spots and hyperpigmentation, consistency and sunscreen matter the most. Most people begin seeing improvement in 6–8 weeks, while deeper pigmentation can take around 6 months.\n\nA simple routine:\n- Morning: Cleanser → Brightening treatment → Moisturiser → Sunscreen\n- Night: Cleanser → Pigmentation treatment → Moisturiser\n\nHelpful options:\n- [Melalumin Face Wash](melalumin-face-wash)\n- [Brilante Intense Brightening Serum](brilante-intense-brightening-serum)\n- [Epifade Cream](epifade-cream)\n- [UV Doux Mineral Sunscreen Gel SPF 50 PA+++](uv-doux-mineral-sunscreen-gel-spf-50-pa)\n\n",
